include README.md LICENSE CHANGELOG.md CONTRIBUTING.md SECURITY.md
include README.zh-CN.md CONTRIBUTING.zh-CN.md SECURITY.zh-CN.md CHANGELOG.zh-CN.md
recursive-include docs *.md
